{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49548","headline":"秋夜月 · 尹鹗","name":"秋夜月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三秋佳节，罥晴空，凝碎露，茱萸千结。\n菊蘂和烟轻捻，酒浮金屑。\n徵云雨，调丝竹，此时难辍。\n欢极，一片艳歌声揭。\n黄昏慵别，炷沈烟，熏绣被，翠帷同歇。\n醉竝鸳鸯双枕，煖偎春雪。\n语丁宁，情委曲，论心正切。\n夜深，窗透数条斜月。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尹鹗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49548.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49548","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}